# The build context is os/pkgs/mosd/deb/, the producer family directory, and
# this producer needs three things out of it: the shared copyright file, its own
# control templates and its own maintainer scripts. Everything else -- the
# README, and the mosd producer that sits beside it -- is excluded, so an edit
# there does not invalidate this producer's context.
#
# The binaries and the unit files are NOT here. They arrive through the `bin`,
# `mqttd-dist` and `broker-dist` named contexts, which is what keeps a cargo
# target directory of several gigabytes out of the path buildx has to walk.
*
!copyright
!mqtt/control/*.control
!mqtt/maintainer/mos-mqttd/postinst
!mqtt/maintainer/mos-mqtt-broker/postinst
